{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o020d","title":"夏侯威惠和任州郡官","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o020d-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"夏侯威惠和任州郡官","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o020d-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xiahoucao-p0021","role":"任官","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o020d-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0022","role":"任官","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o020d-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0145","role":"任官","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o020d-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"夏侯渊死后至子孙嗣封","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o020d-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o020d-q","source_order":[9,86,"O020d"],"order":2158},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p011a","title":"夏侯惠以才学历散骑黄门与钟毓辩驳迁燕相乐安太守卒","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p011a-account","label":"《文章叙录》","text":"夏侯惠以才学历散骑黄门与钟毓辩驳迁燕相乐安太守卒","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p011a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xiahoucao-p0022","role":"历官辩驳而卒","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p011a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0093","role":"辩驳","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p011a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"夏侯惠仕魏时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p011a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-p011a-q","source_order":[9,104,"P011a"],"order":2168},{"id":"wangwei-e-cbda31d0aeb3d24b6019","title":"散骑侍郎夏侯惠上疏荐刘劭，称其深忠笃思、群才咸取所同，宜辅翼机事、纳谋帏幄","accounts":[{"id":"wangwei-a-cbda31d0aeb3d24b6019","label":"正文","text":"散骑侍郎夏侯惠上疏荐刘劭，称其深忠笃思、群才咸取所同，宜辅翼机事、纳谋帏幄","evidence":["wangwei-q-05adcdd7cd2e3b686acb"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xiahoucao-p0022","role":"荐劭者","evidence":["wangwei-q-05adcdd7cd2e3b686acb"]},{"person":"huanchen-p0003","role":"被荐者","evidence":["wangwei-q-05adcdd7cd2e3b686acb"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wangwei-q-05adcdd7cd2e3b686acb"]},"ordering_evidence":"wangwei-q-05adcdd7cd2e3b686acb","order":4369}],"persons":[{"id":"xiahoucao-p0022","name":"夏侯惠","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o020","wangwei-q-05adcdd7cd2e3b686acb","wangwei-q-7e6618fac7cea14bb423"],"facts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-f0038","label":"字","text":"稚权","evidence":["xiahoucao-f0038-q"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-f0039","label":"卒年年龄","text":"三十七","evidence":["xiahoucao-f0039-q"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"稚权","evidence":["xiahoucao-f0038-q"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o020-xiahoucao-p0022","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o020"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-p011-xiahoucao-p0022","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p011"]},{"id":"wangwei-m-6c9ba5a89b24edab49d6","kind":"mention","text":"裴松之评夏侯惠荐刘劭有溢美之辞","evidence":["wangwei-q-7e6618fac7cea14bb423"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wangwei-q-05adcdd7cd2e3b686acb","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-7d66831023b4429e3a53","layer":"original","quote":"时诏书博求众贤。散骑侍郎夏侯惠荐劭曰〖20〗：“伏见常侍刘劭：深忠笃思，体周于数〖21〗；凡所错综〖22〗，源流弘远；是以群才大小，咸取所同而斟酌焉。故性实之士服其平和良正；清静之人慕其玄虚退让；文学之士嘉其推步详密〖23〗，法理之士明其分数精比〖24〗；意思之士知其沉深笃固〖25〗；文章之士爱其著论属辞；制度之士贵其化略较要；策谋之士赞其明思通微。凡此诸论，皆取适己所长而举其支流者也。臣数听其清谈〖26〗，览其笃论〖27〗，渐渍历年，服膺弥久〖28〗，实为朝廷奇其器量。以为若此人者，宜辅翼机事，纳谋帏幄；当与国道俱隆，非世俗所常有也。惟陛下垂优游之听〖29〗，使劭承清闲之欢〖30〗，得自尽于前〖31〗；则德音上通，辉耀日新矣。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":351,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":322},{"id":"wangwei-q-7e6618fac7cea14bb423","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-d33f91400c4f6f08fd14","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞臣松之以为：凡相称荐，率多溢美之辞，能不违中者或寡矣。惠之称劭，云“玄虚退让”及“明思通微”，近于过也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":385,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b014346488e0027f6317","start":0,"end":55},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o020d-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-fa4c25b726867680170c","layer":"original","quote":"霸弟威，官至兖州刺史。﹝二﹞威弟惠，乐安太守。﹝三﹞惠弟和，河南尹。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":127,"end":161},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p011a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-58ce9f744dd719ec2bf3","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《文章叙录》曰：“惠字稚权。幼以才学见称，善属奏议。历散骑、黄门侍郎。与钟毓数有辩驳，事多见从。迁燕相、乐安太守。年三十七卒。”","attribution":"《文章叙录》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b7101d15d20fb4239563","start":0,"end":67},{"id":"xiahoucao-f0038-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-58ce9f744dd719ec2bf3","layer":"pei","quote":"惠字稚权","attribution":"《文章叙录》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b7101d15d20fb4239563","start":12,"end":16},{"id":"xiahoucao-f0039-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-58ce9f744dd719ec2bf3","layer":"pei","quote":"年三十七卒","attribution":"《文章叙录》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b7101d15d20fb4239563","start":60,"end":65},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o020","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-fa4c25b726867680170c","layer":"original","quote":"渊妻，太祖内妹〖12〗。长子衡，尚太祖弟海阳哀侯女，恩宠特隆。衡袭爵，转封安宁亭侯。黄初中，赐中子霸；太和中，赐霸四弟爵：皆关内侯。霸，正始中为讨蜀护军、右将军〖13〗，进封博昌亭侯。素为曹爽所厚，闻爽诛，自疑，亡入蜀。以渊旧勋，赦霸子，徙乐浪郡。﹝一﹞霸弟威，官至兖州刺史。﹝二﹞威弟惠，乐安太守。﹝三﹞惠弟和，河南尹。﹝四﹞衡薨，子绩嗣，为虎贲中郎将。绩薨。子褒嗣。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p011","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-58ce9f744dd719ec2bf3","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《文章叙录》曰：“惠字稚权。幼以才学见称，善属奏议。历散骑、黄门侍郎。与钟毓数有辩驳，事多见从。迁燕相、乐安太守。年三十七卒。”","attribution":"《文章叙录》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b7101d15d20fb4239563","start":0,"end":67}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
